photos/paperwork.webp" srcset="/assets/img/photos/paperwork-640.webp 640w, /assets/img/photos/paperwork.webp 960w" sizes="(max-width:700px) 100vw, 33vw" width="960" height="641" alt="" loading="lazy" decoding="async"></a><div class="gcard-b"><p class="meta">May 26, 2026 · 8 min read</p><h2><a href="/appraisal-know-how/reading-an-xactimate-estimate/">Reading an Xactimate Estimate Line by Line</a></h2><p>Insurance estimates use codes and abbreviations that hide important details. Here is how to read one and spot what’s missing.</p></div></article></div></div></section><section class="cta-strip"><div class="wrap cta-in rv"><div><h2>Not sure the payout covers the repair?</h2><p>Send the insurer’s estimate. We’ll read it line by line and tell you what we see.</p></div><div class="btn-row"><a class="btn btn-y" href="tel:+18445371427"><svg class="ico" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M22 16.9v3a2 2 0 0 1-2.2 2 19.8 19.8 0 0 1-8.6-3.1 19.5 19.5 0 0 1-6-6A19.8 19.8 0 0 1 2.1 4.2 2 2 0 0 1 4.1 2h3a2 2 0 0 1 2 1.7c.1.9.4 1.8.7 2.7a2 2 0 0 1-.5 2.1L8 9.8a16 16 0 0 0 6 6l1.3-1.3a2 2 0 0 1 2.1-.4c.9.3 1.8.6 2.7.7a2 2 0 0 1 1.7 2z"/></svg> (844) 537-1427</a><a class="btn btn-line-w" href="/schedule-a-consult/">Email the estimate</a></div></div></section>
